# Planted schedule (properties.rs election-safety scenario)

Derived from `planted_skip_vote_persist_fails_election_safety` (Cluster seed 5).
Not a `swarm_plan` dump.

hook skip_vote_persist node=0
partition 1->2 cut
partition 0->2 cut
recover 0,1,2
cancel election timers on 0 and 2
fire election timer on 1
wait until node 0 grants a vote
crash 0
recover 0
partition 0->1 cut
partition 0->2 heal
fire election timer on 2
expect ElectionSafety
